<title>NORWAY: Norway jobless rate falls to 3.4 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Norway jobless rate falls to 3.4 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     APRIL 1997  MARCH 1997   APRIL 1996</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	   3.4	    3.6	   4.2</p>
<p> Unemployed			76,245	 81,500	 91,926</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			 79,543	81,287	  94,342</p>
<p>Note: The Labour Directorate issued the April figures ahead of schedule.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
